<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 47.6 percent in the week ended December 6, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 69.8 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 36.5 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 18.9 percent to 610.7 from a revised 513.7 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 0.6 percent to 219.2 in the latest survey from a revised 220.5 in the previous week.  </p>
